OL,3,GNEWSADads face homophobic abuse over
OL,4,Awedding photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple from Wigan have said they were
OL,7,Fsubjected to hundreds of homophobic
OL,8,Fmessages after sharing photographs of
OL,9,Ftheir wedding online.
OL,11,FSteven and Conor Bonilla-Graham-Darby,
OL,12,Ffrom Leigh, tied the knot in June,
OL,13,Fafter 15 years together. Their
OL,14,F10-year-old son George acted as best
OL,15,Fman.
OL,17,FBut Steven said what should have been
OL,18,Fthe happiest day of their lives became
OL,19,Fthe start of months of "trauma".
